Sòti ekri: ['Test object'], nouvo-liy.
>> cmd := Kòmand nouvo.
Sòti ekri: cmd ls /tmp, nouvo-liy.
>> old-cmd-address := cmd pwototip adrès-memwa.
cmd save-as: ['/tmp/a.bin'].
Sòti ekri: ['========== RELOADING SNAP:'], nouvo-liy.
>> b := Objè load-from: ['/tmp/a.bin'].
(b pwototip adrès-memwa = old-cmd-address) vre: {
	Sòti ekri: ['Object link re-attached.'], nouvo-liy.
}.
Sòti ekri: b ls, nouvo-liy.


